      intermediate: { question: 'Does v.15 mean everyone is already a Buddha?', options: ['A) Yes', 'B) Not conventionally — beings differ in realization. ULTIMATELY, all share the same nature (emptiness). This is the BASIS for potential Buddhahood.', 'C) No connection', 'D) Only some beings'], correct: 'B', explanation: 'Conventional difference + ultimate identity. All CAN become Buddhas.' },
